                <pb facs="0138" n="34" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg34"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Mizner</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-07-19"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 19,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Adee acknowledges receipt of Mr. Mizner’s telegrams of the 16th and 8th
                    instant, the former from Mexico, the latter from El Paso; asks, him where he is,
                    and advises him that the Department’s answer to his last telegram was sent by
                    way of Mexico.</p>
            </div>
